SOLUTION 0  Infilling
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0
    -units mmol/kgw
SOLUTION 1-10  Initial
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0
    -units mmol/kgw
EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate 1
TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -lengths 1
    -time_step 1
    -diffusion_coefficient 0
    -dispersivities 0
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.txt
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
USER_PUNCH
    -headings step cell sc
10  PUNCH SIM_NO, CELL_NO, SC
END
